OL,3,GNEWSATrain company sorry over messy
OL,4,Ayellow paint
OL,5,
OL,6,FA train operator has apologised after
OL,7,Fyellow paint failed to dry in time and
OL,8,Fspread across a station and got on to
OL,9,Fpassengers' clothes and shoes.
OL,11,FLondon Northwestern Railway (LNR) said
OL,12,Fthe painting was done in Long Buckby,
OL,13,FNorthamptonshire, over the weekend.
OL,15,F"We are aware of painting work carried
OL,16,Fout by a contractor at Long Buckby
OL,17,Fstation where the paint was not given
OL,18,Fenough time to dry," LNR said.
OL,20,F"We are sorry for the inconvenience
OL,21,Fcaused and have arranged for the
OL,22,Fstation to be cleaned."
